WEBVTT

00:06:27.341 --> 00:06:30.511
and they've found that 82 percent
of hiring managers

00:06:30.511 --> 00:06:32.972
and 67 percent of HR professionals

00:06:33.013 --> 00:06:36.016
find that the quality
of fair-chance talent

00:06:36.058 --> 00:06:40.855
is the same or higher
than employees without records.

00:06:40.855 --> 00:06:44.316
To assume that because someone
has a criminal record,

00:06:44.316 --> 00:06:45.651
they're not qualified,

00:06:45.651 --> 00:06:48.988
is just not a correct assumption.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.116
In fact, for so many reasons,

00:06:52.158 --> 00:06:53.617
for so many reasons,

00:06:53.659 --> 00:06:57.204
they can become your most dedicated,
your most motivated,

00:06:57.204 --> 00:06:59.039
your most hardworking employee,

00:06:59.039 --> 00:07:02.084
because for them,
the stakes are so much higher.